aystyle=\"true\" columnalign=\"right left\" columnspacing=\"0em\" rowspacing=\"3pt\"><mtr><mtd><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>12</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>12</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>0.25</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>12</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>0.25</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>12</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>.</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Therefore, the rate of change of the crocodile population in the river in <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"38\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2012</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is approximately <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"39\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\